     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>25% of 1,200</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Rewrite “of” as multiplication.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{{25}}{{100}} \\times 1,200\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Simplify.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{{25 \\times 12 \\times \\cancel{{100}}}}{{\\cancel{{100}}}}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"300\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
    },
    {
